sgp 2

given
  e1 = ellipse(O)
    a1: a(e1) = 5
    b1: b(e1) = 3
  point A

construct
  B = tangent(A, e1)
  segment AB

find
  d1: |AB|
  y_B: y(B)

where
  e1 a 5 b 3 angle 0° [fixed angle]
  A (7, 0) [fixed]
  B (3.5714285714285716, 2.0995626366712954)
  a1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  b1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  d1 label (0.3, 0.3)
  y_B label (0.3, 0.3)
